209	pvvw37kmgpk5ujo8khlnder9	Amidex	Aix-Marseille University	\N	A*Midex (Aix-Marseille Initiative of Excellence) funded the first major wave of digitisation for the AI Library between 2019 and 2022, enabling the creation of high-quality digital corpora of philosophical and scientific texts. It also supported the early prototyping of the AI Library’s LLM-based Philosopher Personas, providing the resources needed to explore how large language models can emulate reasoning styles and conceptual frameworks drawn from major thinkers. This dual support established the foundational infrastructure for the current AI Library module.	f	2025-11-13 13:10:26.216	2025-11-21 13:58:06.553	\N	\N	\N	en
